  "turkish_executive_summary": "Sprint 10.03 kapsam\u0131nda CBE Market Intelligence i\u00e7in ilk s\u00fcr\u00fcm kontroll\u00fc, salt-okunur (read-only) API mimarisinin (/api/v1/intelligence/) kurulumu ve kan\u0131ta duyarl\u0131 entegrasyonu tamamlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r:\n1. API Mimarisi ve U\u00e7 Noktalar: Hi\u00e7bir harici framework eklenmeden, mevcut BaseHTTPRequestHandler altyap\u0131s\u0131 kullan\u0131larak 10 i\u015flevsel \u00fcr\u00fcn alan\u0131 + OpenAPI 3.1 spesifikasyonu i\u00e7in hafif (< 5 ms yan\u0131t s\u00fcresi) u\u00e7 noktalar tesis edilmi\u015ftir.\n2. Kan\u0131ta Duyarl\u0131 Yan\u0131t Zarflar\u0131: T\u00fcm yan\u0131tlar model versiyonu, zaman damgas\u0131, veri modu ve a\u00e7\u0131k bilimsel kan\u0131t etiketlerini (CHRONOLOGICALLY_VERIFIED_EXPLORATORY, VALIDATED_WITH_LIMITATIONS_EXPLORATORY, INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE vb.) i\u00e7ermektedir.\n3. Rejim ve Olas\u0131l\u0131k G\u00fcvenli\u011fi: Dondurulmu\u015f modeldeki persentil hatas\u0131 nedeniyle ham rejim \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131s\u0131 fail-closed olarak UNKNOWN durumuna \u00e7ekilmi\u015f; Spot-Only modundaki kuyruk (0.05) ve s\u0131\u00e7rama (0.01) riskleri kesin olarak STATIC_FALLBACK_CONSTANT olarak etiketlenmi\u015ftir.\n4. 5 Ayr\u0131 Zaman Damgal\u0131 Tazelik: Mum kapan\u0131\u015f\u0131, tahmin kayd\u0131, sonu\u00e7 olgunla\u015fmas\u0131, veri al\u0131m\u0131 ve do\u011frulama zaman damgalar\u0131 birbirinden ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z olarak sunulmu\u015f, 30 dakikal\u0131k bayatl\u0131k e\u015fi\u011fi entegre edilmi\u015ftir.\n5. G\u00fcvenlik ve B\u00fct\u00fcnl\u00fck: S\u0131f\u0131r i\u015flem rotas\u0131, s\u0131f\u0131r durum mutasyonu, s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f sayfalama (maks 100), 29/29 kanonik dosya dondurulmu\u015f b\u00fct\u00fcnl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc ve APPROVAL4=FALSE korunmu\u015ftur."
}